1
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:03,560
A, B, C, R, T, C, M

2
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:59,860
A powerful light shot from his eyes. For a moment the light reached the cloud palace in heaven.

3
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:08,260
The Jade Emperor, ruler of heaven, sat up. He turned to one of his captains who was standing nearby.

4
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:11,480
Find out what caused that light.

5
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:12,560
Said the Emperor.

6
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:14,200
Yes, your majesty.

7
00:01:14,620 --> 00:01:19,340
Said the captain. The captain rushed out of the hall.

8
00:01:21,530 --> 00:01:25,210
He looked out the southern gate of heaven and saw the monkey on earth below.

9
00:01:25,210 --> 00:01:30,350
The light was gone, but the captain had a magical sight.

10
00:01:31,230 --> 00:01:33,510
He could see everything that had just happened.

11
00:01:36,270 --> 00:01:36,730
Said the captain.

12
00:01:39,210 --> 00:01:39,850
Well?

13
00:01:40,410 --> 00:01:42,650
Said the Jade Emperor when the captain returned.

14
00:01:43,610 --> 00:01:44,590
What caused the light?

15
00:01:46,230 --> 00:01:47,010
It was a monkey.

16
00:01:47,490 --> 00:01:48,010
Said the captain.

17
00:01:49,070 --> 00:01:49,750
A monkey!

18
00:01:50,210 --> 00:01:51,190
Asked the Jade Emperor.

19
00:01:52,150 --> 00:01:52,530
Yes.

20
00:01:52,890 --> 00:01:53,550
Said the captain.

21
00:01:53,550 --> 00:01:56,710
He's on the fruit and flower mountain down on earth.

22
00:01:57,390 --> 00:01:59,310
There had been a rock on the mountain.

23
00:02:00,610 --> 00:02:02,590
The monkey came from the rock.

24
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:05,090
The light shone from the monkey's eyes.

25
00:02:08,300 --> 00:02:10,840
The Emperor thought for a moment and then shrugged.

26
00:02:12,380 --> 00:02:13,340
I'm not surprised.

27
00:02:13,940 --> 00:02:14,340
He said.

28
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:18,520
Amazing things happen when heaven and earth work together.

29
00:02:32,190 --> 00:02:36,390
As time passed, monkey learned to walk, run and climb.

30
00:02:36,390 --> 00:02:42,430
He drank from streams and ate grasses and leaves.

31
00:02:45,260 --> 00:02:48,520
He gathered fruit and explored caves and mountaintops.

32
00:02:53,300 --> 00:02:56,360
He became friends with all the other monkeys and apes.

33
00:02:57,660 --> 00:03:00,280
At night, he slept under a cliff.

34
00:03:01,820 --> 00:03:03,400
One very hot morning.

35
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:06,480
All the monkeys and apes were playing in the shade.

36
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:10,040
It is so hot today.

37
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:11,420
Cried one monkey.

38
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:14,480
Let's play in the stream.

39
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:16,200
Good idea.

40
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:17,480
Said another monkey.

41
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:20,260
The monkeys and apes ran to the stream.

42
00:03:21,220 --> 00:03:23,520
The water rolled and bounced over the rocks.

43
00:03:25,910 --> 00:03:27,870
The monkeys jumped into the cool water.

44
00:03:30,110 --> 00:03:31,810
Everyone splashed and played.

45
00:03:32,770 --> 00:03:35,910
After a few minutes, one monkey scratched her head.

46
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:39,440
She said.

47
00:03:40,540 --> 00:03:41,720
We drink from it.

48
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:42,900
We swim in it.

49
00:03:43,440 --> 00:03:45,880
We know that it flows all the way to the ocean.

50
00:03:46,860 --> 00:03:49,600
But does anyone know where the stream begins?

51
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:53,340
Everyone looked at one another and shook their heads.

52
00:03:55,310 --> 00:03:57,250
We have nothing to do today.

53
00:03:57,650 --> 00:03:58,650
The monkey continued.

54
00:03:59,550 --> 00:04:02,290
Why don't we follow the stream to find its source?

55
00:04:03,290 --> 00:04:04,770
That sounds like fun.

56
00:04:05,110 --> 00:04:05,990
Said another monkey.

57
00:04:06,990 --> 00:04:07,630
Let's go.

58
00:04:07,970 --> 00:04:09,030
Said a third monkey.

59
00:04:09,870 --> 00:04:11,550
Everyone jumped out of the water.

60
00:04:12,350 --> 00:04:16,050
They ran alongside the stream and swung from tree to tree.

61
00:04:16,850 --> 00:04:20,030
They jumped over rocks and climbed up steep cliffs.

62
00:04:20,910 --> 00:04:26,030
Higher and higher they went up the mountain until they reached an enormous waterfall.

63
00:04:26,630 --> 00:04:28,250
Mist filled the air.

64
00:04:29,070 --> 00:04:31,570
The water crashed down roaring like thunder.

65
00:04:34,820 --> 00:04:36,660
I wonder what's behind that waterfall?

66
00:04:37,100 --> 00:04:37,980
Said one monkey.

67
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:39,680
Me too.

68
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:41,060
Said a second monkey.

69
00:04:41,940 --> 00:04:43,640
But nobody could jump through it.

70
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:47,940
Whoever can jump through and come back alive will be our king.

71
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:48,840
Said a given.

72
00:04:49,700 --> 00:04:51,340
Is anyone brave enough to try?

73
00:04:52,270 --> 00:04:54,600
All the monkeys and apes looked at one another.

74
00:04:55,220 --> 00:04:56,640
They shook their heads.

75
00:04:59,020 --> 00:05:00,880
I'm not going to try.

76
00:05:01,540 --> 00:05:02,460
Said a tall monkey.

77
00:05:04,500 --> 00:05:05,560
Me neither.

78
00:05:05,860 --> 00:05:06,860
Said a short monkey.

79
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:08,960
A voice called out.

80
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:10,060
I'll do it.

81
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:14,360
Everyone moved out of the way as the speaker stepped forward.

82
00:05:15,260 --> 00:05:16,460
It was monkey.

83
00:05:17,620 --> 00:05:18,560
Are you sure?

84
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:19,400
Asked the given.

85
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:20,880
It looks dangerous.

86
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:22,940
Monkey laughed.

87
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:25,200
I'm not afraid of anything.

88
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,920
And when I come back, I will be king.

89
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:32,200
Monkey took a deep breath and leaped into the waterfall.
